OSINT Layer

“City of two letters” → Pi’s journey starts in Pondicherry (PY).

“Ended where the waves whisper in Spanish” → Tomatlán, Mexico (the final shore).

So players must OSINT search the movie plot to confirm these locations.


Crypto Layer 1 (Caesar)

Ciphertext given: Ymj vznhp gwtbs ktc ozruji tajw ymj qfed itl.

This is Caesar shift +5.

Decrypt → “The quick brown fox jumped over the lazy dog.” (decoy text).


Crypto Layer 2 (Pi Key)

The text is a red herring unless they notice “Key = First 10 digits after the decimal.”

First 10 digits of Pi = 1415926535.

Use this as a Vigenère key or multi-shift Caesar (per digit).

Example method: shift each letter by successive Pi digits.

Apply to the ciphertext again → reveals hidden coordinates.

Result: 20.0531, -105.2506 → near Tomatlán, Mexico.




Final Step

Players must drop the coordinates into Google Maps → find Playa de Oro beach.

There, a clue (e.g., in challenge infrastructure) reveals the final flag.



